This repository contains a **partial subset of the S2E dataset**, supporting research on commercial vehicle dynamics, energy consumption, control algorithms, autonomous driving and related topics.


> 
> This is NOT the complete dataset. Data uploading is still in progress due to network limitations.
> For access to more / full dataset, please contact: jieyu-wang@hotmail.com

> 
> Optional license note:
> The dataset is available for academic research only. Commercial use is prohibited without permission.
